n-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Evaluation of DNA damage induced by atrazine and atrazine-based herbicide in human lymphocytes in vitro using a comet and DNA diffusion assay.</article-title><source>Toxicol In Vitro</source><volume>20</volume><fpage>923</fpage><lpage>35</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16527446</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005186-Ribas1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ribas</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Frenzilli</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Barale</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Marcos</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>1995</year><article-title>Herbicide-induced DNA damage in human lymphocytes evaluated by the single-cell gel electrophoresis (SCGE) assay.</article-title><source>Mutat Res</source><volume>344</volume><fpage>41</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7565891</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005186-Pino1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pino</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Maura</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Grillo</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>1988</year><article-title>DNA damage in stomach, kidney, liver and lung of rats treated with atrazine.</article-title><source>Mutat Res</source><volume>209</volume><fpage>145</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3193977</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005186-Della1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Della</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Morichetti</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Intorre</surname><given-names>L</given-names><